	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "nRCzlGbens2EcDefH",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 20, DX 10, IQ 3, HT 12, HP 20, WILL 9, PER 10, FP 12, SPEED 5.5, MOVE 5, DODGE 8, DR 4. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "n6YLGCcn9MrgKFGdp",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 30 (offense 15, protection 15), threat tier standard, appearing 2."
		},
		{
			"id": "nt5llKZSRNCCm9ckp",
			"text": "Death Roll: Death Roll: Reach C. Against a target it already has in its jaws, the crocodile rolls its whole body. No attack roll; the victim rolls ST or DX to break the grip or is dragged under and drowned."
		},
		{
			"id": "nDCmu9VPXTW7hPgQD",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/crocodile.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "n08RejcO3RmxLUmnL",
			"text": "Independent build total: -28 points of racial traits plus 18 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "n9fVAWUP3930ZpGfC",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Crocodile (SRD 5.1); Crocodile (SRD 3.5). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "nw7LSvtBypDdKlNfL",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "nF-th63fhT_J0IB1P",
			"text": "Body mass used to scale this build: 350 kg. ST, Size Modifier and DR are checked against it; see the gurps-animal-sanity-check skill for the bands."
		},
		{
			"id": "nEqQcCzyReehEFgaa",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 5; water Move 5, 7 at a sprint (primary). The published Move is the primary medium's cruising Move; sprint figures are stated here and not folded into it."
		},
		{
			"id": "nYXlojoEYVOR_tDsI",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "nWUHVcBG5o-wSYCtd",
			"text": "Four metres nose to tail puts it on the SM +2 row. Length, not mass, is what the published table reads."
		},
		{
			"id": "nT1btOL1rUPQvLXYQ",
			"text": "ST from Basic Lift: it drags an 80 kg carcass into the water, which is the job its strength has to do."
		},
		{
			"id": "nVOrm6ylSSKc-AtHN",
			"text": "DR is full armour rather than Tough Skin: osteoderms are bone plates, not thick hide."
		},
		{
			"id": "nLPDYziJ7Fxld1Xcc",
			"text": "Added after a post-hoc comparison against independent GURPS fan conversions of this creature: Peripheral Vision; Rapid Healing; Resistant To Disease; the Tracking skill, which a creature with Discriminatory Smell should always have. The comparison surfaced the gap; the build is still ours."
		},
		{
			"id": "n_ZEdLmLPwUZWGFCu",
			"text": "Monster statistics, ratings and description prose by Monsters on Automatic; AI-generated first draft, project-reviewed, released under CC BY 4.0."
		}
	],
